$$ \delta(t) = \begin{cases} 1, 0 \le t \lt 1 \\
0, otherwise \end{cases}$$
in Matlab. 

Answer: Create a MATLAB function with the following code 
 function d = delta(t)
if t >= 1
  d = 0;
else if t < 0
  d = 0;
else
  d = 1;
end
end

 And use  delta  for whatever reasons you want. 
